#. Key: TITLE_PREFACE
msgid "PREFACE"
msgstr "NIFH"

#. Key: BODY_PREFACE
msgid ""
"<br>Ahh......................................................................."
"...................."
"............................................................................ n"
"ature.<br><br>\t"
"What greater ecstacy in this life than crunching down on a succulent granola b"
"ar while the wind "
"blows across your scalp atop one of this world's many miraculous mountaintops?"
"<br><br>\tBut of "
"course, nature is not just some fairground amusement, some attraction we might"
" enjoy leisurely "
"from behind glass! Indeed, nature is as dangerous as it is beautiful. And the "
"view is much better "
"from 10,000 feet up than 6 feet under! (Dead)<br><br>\tIn my 40 years as a Sco"
"utmaster, I've "
"accumulated a variety of rules for surviving dangerous wilderness situations t"
"hat should help you "
"out in the unlikely event one of your scout outings goes horribly wrong. But o"
"f course, all of "
"these rules pale in comparison to the guiding rule of all scoutdom..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE0
msgid "NEVER ABANDON A FRIEND IN NEED!"
msgstr "SEIPEKRH PIPI PAHDENG DEI NWNYEN!"

#. Key: RULE0SIGNATURE
msgid "-Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr "-Pahdep Padanyei Khke"

#. Key: RULE
msgid "RULE"
msgstr "DEHFINEING"

#. Key: TITLE_RULE1
msgid "KEEP MOVING!"
msgstr "KRICHA PI!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE1
msgid ""
"\tFirst things first: you've gotta get to HIGH GROUND if you wanna be spotted."
" Nobody ever got "
"rescued off of a mysterious island by loitering around on the beach. So find t"
"he nearest peak, "
"and start making your way there."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_1
msgid ""
"\tTime is of the essence in the wilderness, so get running towards your destin"
"ation!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_1
msgid "[AIM]LOOK AROUND"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_2
msgid "[MOVE]WALK"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_3
msgid "[SPRINT]SPRINT"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_2
msgid ""
"\tSee a gap in the trail, or a prickly thorn? Go ahead and JUMP over it!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_4
msgid "[JUMP]JUMP"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_3
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that jumping while sprinting will tire you out quickly! Take a qu"
"ick rest if you "
"need to - you won't do anyone any favors by passing out on the mountain!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE2
msgid "KEEP MOVING (UP)!"
msgstr "KRICHA PREIHEPPIHE!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE2
msgid ""
"\tObviously, you're not going to make it up a mountain without climbing.<br><b"
"r>\tYou can climb "
"almost any surface, so long as you have the stamina!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_1
msgid "HOLD[USEPRIMARY]EMPTY-HANDED: GRAB WALL"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_2
msgid "[JUMP]IN AIR: GRAB WALL"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_3
msgid "[SPRINT]WHILE CLIMBING: LUNGE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE3
msgid "ALWAYS LEND A HAND!"
msgstr "FAHT FANIVARI YH!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE3
msgid ""
"\tNothing is more important than sticking together as a team!<br><br>\tWhen yo"
"ur hands are empty, "
"reach out to a friend who's mid-climb and help them reach the next ledge safel"
"y!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE3
msgid "[USESECONDARY] EMPTY-HANDED: HELP UP FRIEND"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE3_1
msgid ""
"\tYou can help from below, too! Crouch down and let a fellow scout stand on yo"
"ur head, then jump "
"to give them a boost!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE3_1
msgid "[CROUCH]CROUCH"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE4
msgid "STAY ALERT, STAY ALIVE!"
msgstr "KRICHA HWVE, KRICHA MW!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE4
msgid ""
"\tAn effective scout keeps an eye on their <color=#0f7f00>Stamina Bar</color> "
"at all times. If it "
"runs out, you'll be temporarily unable to run, jump, and most importantly, cli"
"mb. <br><br>\tWorst "
"case scenario, you could fall off the mountain to your death, which is the wor"
"st thing to fall "
"off to!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE5
msgid "LIFE IS PAIN!"
msgstr "MWM MW KREIM!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE5
msgid ""
"\tAs you make your way through the untamed wilderness, it's inevitable that yo"
"u'll get some "
"scratches and bumps.<br><br>\tThe more hurt you get, the less <color=#0f7f00>S"
"tamina</color> "
"you'll have to run and climb, so tend to your injuries as soon as possible wit"
"h a bandage or a "
"healing herb!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE6
msgid "STAY HUNGRY"
msgstr "KRICHA NWNGNIFWM"

#. Key: TITLE_RULE6_1
msgid "<BR><SIZE=30>(ACTUALLY, DON'T!)"
msgstr "<BR><SIZE=30>(KRAHGEI HEI, PRAIKRH!)"

#. Key: BODY_RULE6
msgid ""
"\tGetting hurt isn't the only way for your <color=#0f7f00>Stamina</color> to g"
"o downhill fast. As "
"you climb, you'll find yourself experiencing <color=#b58200>Hunger</color>, fo"
"r which 10/10 "
"experts recommend eating food.<br><br>\tBe cautious of eating plants from the "
"wilderness! They "
"could poison you and really mess up your day. If you have the option, choose a"
" packaged snack "
"from a corporation you trust!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE7
msgid "DON'T OVERPACK!"
msgstr "DAHFGRH FANIVAI!"

#. Key: BODY_RULE7
msgid ""
"\tPutting a backpack on is a great way to carry additional items, which can ma"
"ke the difference "
"between life and death!<br><br>\tHOWEVER, the more <color=#61380a>Weight</colo"
"r> you carry, the "
"less stamina you'll have to climb! An experienced scout knows to pack everythi"
"ng they need... and "
"nothing more!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE8
msgid ""
"\tIn a survival situation, one of the worst things that can happen is getting "
"separated from the "
"group. <br><br>\tMaintain constant communication whenever possible, and point "
"out your next route "
"in advance to avoid leaving a friend behind!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE8
msgid "KEEP AN EYE OUT!"
msgstr "KRICHA NYEI!"

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE8
msgid "[PING]:PING LOCATION"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_CONCLUSION
msgid ""
"\tExploring the wilderness is a dangerous activity that can kill you instantly"
" - but so is "
"everything in this world worth doing, like falling in love.<br><br>\tNever for"
"get to be a good "
"steward towards our beautiful world, and once again, never forget:"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_CONCLUSION
msgid "IN CONCLUSION"
msgstr "YAHMEIN"

#. Key: BODY_BONUSPAGE0
msgid ""
"Dear Diary, bad news!!!<br><br>\tThe ship captain made an oopsy, and we've wou"
"nd up crashed on "
"this mysterious island! Thankfully, mysterious islands are my specialty.<br><b"
"r>\tWith our whole "
"troop working together, we'll reach the top of the PEAK and signal for help in"
" no time!<br><br>\t"
"In the meantime, I'll take this opportunity to add some additional pages to my"
" famous "
"guidebook.<br><br>\t<align=right>-Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BONUSRULE
msgid "BONUS RULE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE1
msgid "SCAN YOUR SHROOMS!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE1
msgid ""
"\tMushrooms can be a valuable source of nutrition in the wilderness. But watch"
" out!! Some of them "
"can kill you, or even make you poop your pants.<br><br>\tThere's always a way "
"to tell the "
"poisonous ones apart, though. Here's just one example!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE2
msgid "GATHER 'ROUND THE FIRE!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE2
msgid ""
"\tIf you find a nice place to light a campfire, make sure to bring your friend"
"s close by first! "
"The fire brings something even better than heat and cooked food... and that's "
"motivation!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE3
msgid "EMBRACE THE OCCULT!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE3
msgid ""
"\tWuh woh! One of our scouts stepped on a sea urchin and died!!! I was about t"
"o get really sad... "
"but one of the other kids touched a weird statue, and brought their friend bac"
"k to life!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE3_1
msgid ""
"Seems like this island bends the rules of mortality itself... how wacky! Perha"
"ps something else "
"interesting might happen if we use a statue when everyone is still alive..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE4
msgid "HUDDLE UP!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE4
msgid ""
"\tAs we approach the PEAK, the temperature has begun dropping dramatically. Se"
"eking constant "
"cover is a must, and getting caught out in the open when the wind is strong ca"
"n be a death "
"sentence."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE4_1
msgid ""
"\tIf all else fails, huddling with your friends to share body heat might just "
"save you from an "
"icy grave."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE5
msgid "I JUST NEED A NAP..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE5
msgid ""
"\tI saw such a pretty sight... a beautiful moon-shaped fruit, surrounded by fi"
"reflies...<br><br>\t"
"I feel so relaxed now... maybe a nap wouldn't be so bad..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE?
msgid "WHERE'D EVERYONE GO?"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE?
msgid ""
"\tI had such a wonderful nap, but when I woke up the rest of the troop was gon"
"e!<br><br>\tI'm "
"sure they're just around the corner. They wouldn't be so foolish as to break <"
"color=red>Rule "
"0</color> just because I needed a little lie-down!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_CRAZY
msgid "RULE 0 RULE 0 RULE 0 RULE 0"
msgstr "DEHFINEING NWKRH DEHFINEING NWKRH DEHFINEING NWKRH DEHFINEING NWKRH"

#. Key: DONTFORGET
msgid "DON'T FORGET<br><size=150%>RULE 0!"
msgstr "CHAV FRWCHEGRH<br><size=150%>DEHFINEING NWKRH"

#. Key: NEVERABANDON
msgid "Never Abandon a Friend in Need!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: WEMADEIT
msgid ""
"We made it!!<br><br>Even without our scoutmaster's help, we managed to get "
"rescued!<br><br>SněžnýPerník managed to make it up first.<br>Zedorfska made it"
" out without a "
"scratch.<br>CaptainBear was injured but in great spirits.<br>Squdel & Kirpich "
"are a little "
"bruised. Good thing they had each other!<br>Ronokopl kept the team fed and saf"
"e.<br><br>Mr. "
"Myres, if you're reading this... We couldn't find you!! I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

